# Changelog

All notable changes to this project are documented in this file. The format
follows Keep a Changelog.

## 0.1.0 - 2026-10-26

### Added
- One-line installer (`install.sh`) that downloads the latest release, checks
  it against `SHA256SUMS` and installs it. `--dry-run`, `BSB_VERSION` and
  `INSTALL_DIR`.
- Homebrew cask (`Casks/blackshark-battery.rb`); the repository is its own tap.
- GitHub Actions: `ci.yml` runs the Linux tests, the linters and a macOS build
  with a smoke test that needs no dongle; `release.yml` builds and publishes a
  release for a `v*` tag and bumps the cask.
- Docker services for the Linux tests and for swift-format, shellcheck and
  actionlint (`compose.yaml`), with `make test` and `make lint`.
- `SECURITY.md` and a security review in `docs/SECURITY-REVIEW.md`.
- Menu bar app that shows the headset battery level and charging state, with
  Refresh now and Launch at login.
- `--status`, `--listen`, `--device` and `-v` command line options.
- `BatteryCore` library with the frame builders, reply parser, query sequence
  and polling rules, plus unit tests.
- `build.sh`, which builds the Swift package and packages an ad-hoc signed app
  bundle.
- Python reference script for reading the battery over hidapi.
